PREAMBLE: THE AMENTYS PHILOSOPHY

Amentys is not a traditional operating system.

It is designed as an inseparable monolith, merging its kernel, storage system, and user interface into a single entity.

To prevent the fragmentation that divides software engineering (the "Linux syndrome"), this license explicitly
prohibits the creation of derivative distributions (public "forks").

The goal is to focus the community's entire energy on a single, unified official system.

ARTICLE 1: FREE AND UNIVERSAL USE

This software is free by default.

The Original Author (Willy Micieli) grants any person (individuals, companies, institutions) the free, perpetual, and
non-exclusive right to read, study, compile, and use the source code and the compiled software, without distinction
between consumer and enterprise use, subject to compliance with all provisions of this License.

ARTICLE 2: PROHIBITION OF COMMERCIALIZATION AND COMMERCIAL HOSTING

Exclusive Rights: Only the Original Author holds the exclusive right to sell the software, derive direct financial profit from it, or offer it as a
commercial service.
Prohibited Commercial Activities: It is strictly prohibited for any other natural or legal person to sell the original
