Cloud, SaaS, and Hosting Restrictions: You may not provide the Software, whether modified or unmodified, as a
commercial service, including but not limited to Software-as-a-Service (SaaS), Platform-as-a-Service (PaaS),
Infrastructure-as-a-Service (IaaS), or managed hosting services, where the core value or functionality of the service
